{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"2df1f6f1cc16483e","name":"card_event_heartland_defense","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Finland/events/card_event_heartland_defense","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"HEARTLAND DEFENSE","text":"When your HQ receives damage, add a SISSI to your support line. Give it +X+X where X is the damage dealt.","flavorText":"During WWII, Finland fought hard to defend its heartland from Soviet invasion. The Soviet Union aimed to annex Finnish territory, but Finland’s determined resistance became a symbol of national resilience. In the Winter War, though outnumbered, Finnish forces used the terrain and harsh winter to stall the Soviet advance. Defending the Mannerheim Line and using guerrilla tactics, the Finns inflicted heavy losses and forced the Soviets to settle for limited territorial gains in the 1940 peace treaty. In the Continuation War, Finland allied with Germany to regain lost lands, but focused on protecting its own territory rather than pushing deep into the Soviet Union. The Soviet summer offensive of 1944 led to battles like Tali-Ihantala, the largest in Finnish and Nordic history, where Finnish troops held their ground against overwhelming odds. This success allowed Finland to negotiate an armistice and preserve its independence. Finland’s wartime goal was survival, not conquest, and its steadfast defense ensured sovereignty despite immense pressure.","faction":"Finland","type":"gotcha","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":1,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_heartland_defense","title":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_event_heartland_defense_title","SourceString":"HEARTLAND DEFENSE","LocalizedString":"HEARTLAND DEFENSE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::gotcha","faction":"EFactionEnum::Finland","kredits":1,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_event_heartland_defense_text","SourceString":"When your HQ receives damage, add a SISSI to your support lin